1544 HERE bh @ - < .                \ -1 when it exceeds the monolith's 1544 B

\ ---- 50 load/drop cycles must not leak
: R50 0 BEGIN DUP 50 < WHILE 8 OVL 2 OVL 1 + REPEAT DROP ;
